## Registering it
Add `${cls}()` to the registry your application builds (`tl_core.projection.defaults.default_registry` for the built-in ones). A projector must be deterministic: `tests/test_projector_${name}.py` checks that a rebuild gives the same rows. The current-state table of a record type is generated from its schema, not written here.
